*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0050
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 236
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0050.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> PRIOR BANKRUPTCY Y/N
    05 PRIOR-BK-FLG       PIC X.
       88 PRIOR-BANKRUPT VALUE 'Y'.
    *> YEARS SINCE BANKRUPTCY DISCHARGE
    05 YRS-SINCE-BK       PIC 9(2).
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 CREDIT-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
    *> DECISION REASON CODE
    05 REASON-CODE        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "REASON-CODE=" REASON-CODE
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    IF PRIOR-BANKRUPT
        *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE
        IF YRS-SINCE-BK < 7
            SET CREDIT-DECLINED TO TRUE
            MOVE 'BK1' TO REASON-CODE
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
            MOVE 'BK2' TO REASON-CODE
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO REASON-CODE
    END-IF.
